test/check/warning-list-element.sumspec:20:11:
   |
20 | inside :: State.Off -> State.On
   |           ^
warning: inside changes a State inside one Item of a list, but doesn't say which Item; to pick it, give Items a key (Items = [Item by Id]) and use an element path, such as Items[id](...)

test/check/warning-list-element.sumspec:22:10:
