22 | noKey :: Item(State.Off) -> Item(State.On)
   |          ^
warning: noKey changes one Item of a list, but doesn't say which; to pick it, give Items a key (Items = [Item by Id]) and use an element path, such as Items[id](...)

test/check/warning-list-element.sumspec:30:16:
